tes":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_CUNNING"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"I will write my autobiography myself."}],"subjects":["Leader Us"],"text":"As you advance in years, your days are filled with thoughts of legacy. The court wishes to commission an official account of your life. Several scholars have been approached, and our ministers have freed your time to focus on this epic task. This biography could be how the ages remember you, if that is how you choose to be remembered.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Cognomen","triggerData":"the Wise","weight":2},{"author":"Zorbaz","conditions":["Courtier Scientist"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CALENDAR_AND_SEASONS","name":"Calendar and Seasons","options":[{"leadsTo":[{"cat":"on-new-turn-2","id":"EVENTSTORY_PASSAGE_OF_THE_MOON","name":"Passage of the Moon"}],"linkAdd":"EVENTLINK_CALENDAR_AND_SEASONS","outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-120,"per":-30,"text":"-120 Money (-30/city)","yield":"money"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_MONEY=-120","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_MONEY=-30"],"id":"BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"[character] shall investigate and come back with a correction."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"eachCity":60,"text":"+60 Happiness (each city)","yield":"happiness"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiCityYields: YIELD_HAPPINESS=60"],"id":"BONUS_HAPPINESS_GAIN_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"We shall add another month to this year, as my ancestors have done before."}],"subjects":["Us","City Us","Leader Us"],"text":"Learned thinkers and philosophers, farmers and priests alike have long contemplated correcting the current calendar, which is prone to wandering about. The current seasons are out of alignment with the existing calendar by as much as one hundred days, putting critical harvests and sacred festivals at risk.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Cognomen","trigg